               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "\tReview apply deadlocks",
                     "type" : "text"
                  },
                  {
                     "type" : "hardBreak"
                  },
                  {
                     "text" : "o\tDOCUMENT ISSUES WITH DEADLOCK IF ARGUMENT DOES NAYTHING THAT COULD BLOCK!!!",
                     "type" : "text"
                  },
                  {
                     "type" : "hardBreak"
                  },
                  {
                     "text" : "o\tPROBABYL BREAK APPLY AND FINDFIRSTTHAT into ",
                     "type" : "text"
                  },
                  {
                     "type" : "hardBreak"
                  },
                  {
                     "text" : "\tApplyQuickly and FindFirstThatQuickly",
                     "type" : "text"
                  },
                  {
                     "type" : "hardBreak"
                  },
                  {
                     "text" : "o\tThe quickly variants promise not to touch things that could block (esp cause block in something that could call back to our thread and deadlock so simplest to say just does little and cannot block)",
                     "type" : "text"
                  },
                  {
                     "type" : "hardBreak"
                  },
                  {
                     "text" : "o\tOne argument is that ALWAYS definition of APPLY is APPLYQUICKLY",
                     "type" : "text"
                  },
                  {
                     "type" : "hardBreak"
                  },
                  {
                     "text" : "\tIF YOU COULD POSSIBLY BLOCK _ THEN YOUR RESPONABIOLITY TO USE ITERATORS DIRECLTY",
                     "type" : "text"
                  },
                  {
                     "type" : "hardBreak"
                  },
                  {
                     "text" : "\tTHAT MAYBE SIMPLEST DEFINITION – THEND OCUMENT CLEARLY IN THREADS DOC AND IN API FOR Apply/FindFirstThat!!!!",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            }
